            <div class="first-day-block-head">
              <h2 class="font-large contact-title">Getting Ready for Day One</h2>
              <p class="paragraph-regular first-day-text">The best preparation is gentle and gradual. Talk about MindBlossom as a friendly, fun place. Visit together if possible. Let your child pack their own backpack — even a small task builds confidence.</p>
